Hi,

as Elektras test mail indicated - the server is up and running again. We had 
some trouble in the beginning but we sorted it out.

With the new location a few changes come along:  We completely moved to a trac 
based website. This should reduce our maintenance burden and simpify our 
website structure. We already reorganized the pages to give better access to 
the more important information.

The URL (www.)open-mesh.net will point to the trac. The old trac location 
(dev.open-mesh.net) will be redirected to the main website in order to not 
break existing links. All other services (mailing list/svn/downloads) are 
accessible as usual. 

Please let us know if you find broken links, missing files or experience trouble 
related to the new server.

